  "description": "VIDLIH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H58 Eu4 Ge8 N8 O36 2-,2(C8 H20 N1 1+),2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.731-3.762 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.38-107.71°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [NEt4]2[(Ph4Ge4O8)2Eu4(NO3)6(EtOH)2(MeCN)2]·2(MeCN). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
